  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="HHFF9F4E3640A578CDF5DE55A091A9A0F9" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: MS-PGothic;"&gt;1. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: MS-PGothic;"&gt;2. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: MS-PGothic;"&gt;3. Not Applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: MS-PGothic;"&gt;4. None&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: MS-PGothic;"&gt;5. Not Applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal; tab-stops: .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in 5.0in 5.5in 6.0in 6.5in 7.0in; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"&gt;During the three months ended March 31, 2026, pursuant to the Cash Management Agreement among Buckeye Pipe Line Company, L.P. and its affiliates, the Company effected a settlement of its&amp;#160;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;"&gt;receivable from&lt;/span&gt; its affiliate, Buckeye Partners, L.P., in the amount of $73.4 million, previously included in R&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;"&gt;eceivable from&lt;/span&gt;&amp;#160;Affiliated Companies, through a decrease in its Retained Earnings, effectively representing a non-cash distribution to Buckeye Partners, L.P.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock id="HH11476EB422E065C84DE3B12A8533C405" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock>
